on" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span></p><p begin="1:11.514" end="1:12.194" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:11.514" end="1:11.893">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:11.893" end="1:12.194">go!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span></p><p begin="1:28.343" end="1:29.036" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:28.343" end="1:28.689">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:28.689" end="1:29.036">go!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span></p><p begin="1:51.454" end="1:56.290" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.454" end="1:51.853">We&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:51.853" end="1:52.208">see</span> <span begin="1:52.208" end="1:52.373">cre</span><span begin="1:52.373" end="1:52.748">a</span><span begin="1:52.748" end="1:53.098">tion</span> <span begin="1:53.323" end="1:53.641">come</span> <span begin="1:53.641" end="1:54.271">un</span><span begin="1:54.271" end="1:56.290">done</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们将亲眼目睹 造物迈向毁灭</span></p><p begin="1:57.165" end="2:01.578" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.165" end="1:57.508">These</span> <span begin="1:57.508" end="1:57.878">bones</span> <span begin="1:57.878" end="1:58.222">that</span> <span begin="1:58.222" end="1:58.553">bound</span> <span begin="1:58.553" end="1:58.915">us</span> <span begin="1:58.915" end="1:59.253">will</span> <span begin="1:59.253" end="1:59.433">be</span> <span begin="1:59.433" end="2:01.578">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">束缚着我们的骨骼 终将随风而散</span></p><p begin="2:02.640" end="2:07.842" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.640" end="2:03.152">We&apos;ll</span> <span begin="2:03.152" end="2:03.421">stir</span> <span begin="2:03.421" end="2:03.827">our</span> <span begin="2:03.827" end="2:04.205">spi</span><span begin="2:04.205" end="2:04.519">rits</span> <span begin="2:04.519" end="2:04.904">&apos;till</span> <span begin="2:04.904" end="2:05.290">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:05.290" end="2:07.842">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">激荡着我们的灵魂 直至我们融为一体</span></p><p begin="2:08.417" end="2:13.569" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.417" end="2:08.692">Then</span> <span begin="2:08.692" end="2:09.035">soft</span> <span begin="2:09.035" end="2:09.387">as</span> <span begin="2:09.387" end="2:09.584">sha</span><span begin="2:09.584" end="2:10.214">dows</span> <span begin="2:10.214" end="2:10.459">we&apos;ll</span> <span begin="2:10.459" end="2:10.617">be</span><span begin="2:10.617" end="2:13.569">come</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随后化作暗影般轻柔的存在</span></p><p begin="2:39.197" end="2:43.817" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.197" end="2:39.532">We&apos;ll</span> <span begin="2:39.532" end="2:39.854">see</span> <span begin="2:39.854" end="2:40.053">cre</span><span begin="2:40.053" end="2:40.362">a</span><span begin="2:40.362" end="2:40.692">tion</span> <span begin="2:40.907" end="2:41.294">come</span> <span begin="2:41.294" end="2:41.811">un</span><span begin="2:41.811" end="2:43.817">done</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们将亲眼目睹 造物迈向毁灭</span></p><p begin="2:44.920" end="2:49.586" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.920" end="2:45.159">These</span> <span begin="2:45.159" end="2:45.509">bones</span> <span begin="2:45.509" end="2:45.836">that</span> <span begin="2:45.836" end="2:46.197">bound</span> <span begin="2:46.197" end="2:46.548">us</span> <span begin="2:46.548" end="2:46.921">will</span> <span begin="2:46.921" end="2:47.067">be</span> <span begin="2:47.067" end="2:49.586">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">束缚着我们的骨骼 终将随风而散</span></p><p begin="2:52.172" end="2:55.229" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.172" end="2:52.539">Come</span> <span begin="2:52.539" end="2:52.916">un</span><span begin="2:52.916" end="2:55.229">done</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">走向覆灭的深渊</span></p><p begin="3:07.611" end="3:11.951" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.611" end="3:07.931">These</span> <span begin="3:07.931" end="3:08.066">bones</span> <span begin="3:08.066" end="3:08.336">that</span> <span begin="3:08.336" end="3:08.682">bound</span> <span begin="3:08.682" end="3:09.019">us</span> <span begin="3:09.019" end="3:09.386">will</span> <span begin="3:09.386" end="3:09.541">be</span> <span begin="3:09.541" end="3:11.951">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">束缚着我们的骨骼 终将化作灰烬</span></p><p begin="3:12.910" end="3:17.812" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.910" end="3:13.237">We&apos;ll</span> <span begin="3:13.237" end="3:13.587">stir</span> <span begin="3:13.587" end="3:13.906">our</span> <span begin="3:13.906" end="3:14.282">spi</span><span begin="3:14.282" end="3:14.633">rits</span> <span begin="3:14.633" end="3:14.982">&apos;till</span> <span begin="3:14.982" end="3:15.563">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="3:15.563" end="3:17.812">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">激荡着我们的灵魂 直至我们融为一体</span></p><p begin="3:17.812" end="3:18.058" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:17.812" end="3:18.058">Go!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span></p><p begin="3:20.656" end="3:20.786" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:20.656" end="3:20.786">Go!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:20.783" end="3:20.934"><span begin="3:20.783" end="3:20.934">(Go!)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span></span></p><p begin="3:26.218" end="3:26.955" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:26.218" end="3:26.565">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="3:26.565" end="3:26.955">go!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧！</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:26.780" end="3:27.682"><span begin="3:26.780" end="3:26.933">(Go!</span> <span begin="3:26.933" end="3:27.